      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KABUKI WARRIORS (1) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (17.32) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Looks suited here and big improvement expected. TOO BUSY (2) was big odds last time but gave a huge sight after a fast early split, grabbed late but holding on to a placing when a 4.5 lengths second (16.25) over 275m at this track. Leading chance. CARIBBEAN COOL (3) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 16.14 beating Stubborn Mouse. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Should be in this for a long way. AUSSIE SIGMA (7) is worth including after a top-three finish at this track and distance most recently.",
